{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなってごめんなさい(´･ ･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MARQUEEのオフショット♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい撮ったから\nここに載せないやつは、\nモバメで送るね(´｡･o･｡`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/06/21/9509789/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Wひなポーズ٩(｡•ω•｡)﻿و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/06/21/9509789/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あいあいがさ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/06/21/9509789/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫に小判な着物"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また振袖を着るのは\nたぶん3年後･････"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成人式のときかな～～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなは、\nどんな大人になると思いますか？(´｡･o･｡`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20歳のひなはどんなだろう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ想像もつかないけど。\n想像してみてくださいっ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤の振袖はもう着れたから\n成人式は違う振袖選ぼっと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の候補は、水色です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってここに残しとくね(´｡･o･｡`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成人式どの色にしてるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わくわく♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/06/21/9509789/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の握手会☆ミ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4ぶめ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/06/21/9509789/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不思議な髪をやりました、\n命名:ぼんぼりヘア"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あめが6つ収納できます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5ぶめ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛をまとめました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふくは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/06/21/9509789/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水色ストライプの\nオフショルダーワンピース(´｡･o･｡`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなに\n肩出して真夏の？\n真夏みたいだねー？\nといわれました(´｡･o･｡`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうです。正解です。\n真夏のなんです(´｡･o･｡`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏からおさがりをよくいただく！♡\n（以前、番組で真夏がゆっていた）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなつありがとー♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場は名古屋でした！\nなので手羽先食べましたY(＞＜。)Y"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきな手羽先食べれて幸せ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋飯はぜんぶ美味しい！\nぜーんぶひなの好きな食べ物！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった\n皆さんありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠征してきてくれた人沢山いて嬉しいし、\n名古屋でしか来れんって人が\n久しぶり～♡とかずっと会いたかった～♡って言ってくれたりしてとっても嬉しい気持ちになりました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣き出しちゃう子も\n何人かいてなんかすごいひなも泣きそうになった。ひな見て泣いてくれるとか幸せ過ぎる...ありがとう(´>_<｡)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またみんなに会えますよーに☆ミ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/06/21/9509789/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな\nいい夢みれますよーに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は早め更新するね∩´･･`∩"}],"source":"archive"}